<a:Comment>The account group are ERP accounts for vendors and customers or CRM accounts to manage sales opportunities. Accounts can be related to each other e.g. a broker could be related to customer accounts and receive a commission for their purchases.

The entities for SAP ERP accounts are CUSTOMER_SHIP_TO, CUSTOMER_SOLD_TO and CUSTOMER_BILL_TO.
SAP Table_YSTP
Simple customer structure can be formed of- (Payer &amp; Sold-To) or (Bill-to &amp; Ship-to)</a:Comment>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{77894B2F-5C8A-41A3-AAF2-C1D07AC2DAD1},BIM-core,183={8A93395D-F725-4223-9143-A00FB5F1E878},DataArea,8=Customer
{20D43C80-304C-4F1F-937B-E4567B90A759},MappingLevel,3=BCM
{9A2CFDF7-6A96-42F8-B3A6-AF06089F9AB3},MapsToEntity,8=CUSTOMER

</a:ExtendedAttributesText>
