<a:Modifier>Koyel.Ghatak</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>An internal document generated by Shell, indicating that the customer is now ready to purchase Saleable Product SKU&#39;s. This represents a contractual agreement between Shell and a sold-to party about delivering products or providing a service for defined prices, quantities and times.</a:Comment>
