<o:Entity Id="o112">
<a:ObjectID>862FD1C6-59F1-4F04-B50B-CCD15AF0EF82</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>DELIVER_OWN_ACCOUNT</a:Name>
<a:Code>DELIVER_OWN_ACCNT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1728019530</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Koyel.Ghatak</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1728887621</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Koyel.Ghatak</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Deliver for own account (DFOA) refers to the business model, where a Shell Distributor will supply and arrange delivery of a product from their own stock to a Shell customer.   It is when we (Shell) use one of our Distributors to supply products from their stock, to a customer that we hold the sales contract with.  Typically we use this business model for geographically remote customers who can be served more flexibly via a closer distributor. The DFOA business model improves the delivery lead-time, and means we can be more flexible in serving the customer</a:Comment>
<a:ExtendedAttributesText>{77894B2F-5C8A-41A3-AAF2-C1D07AC2DAD1},BIM-core,183={8A93395D-F725-4223-9143-A00FB5F1E878},DataArea,8=Customer
{20D43C80-304C-4F1F-937B-E4567B90A759},MappingLevel,3=BCM
{9A2CFDF7-6A96-42F8-B3A6-AF06089F9AB3},MapsToEntity,8=CUSTOMER

</a:ExtendedAttributesText>
