<a:Comment>Sales Contract agreed between Shell and the Customer. This Contract has number of Terms and Conditions detailing the supply of the Saleable Product SKUs within the scope of the Customer Offer that the contract is for. Contracts are documented using a Contract template and signify the legal underwiting of a &#39;sales agreement&#39; or &#39;deal&#39;. </a:Comment>
